      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "That's interesting to hear! So, what are you working on at the moment?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T11:57:46.006765+00:00"
    },
    {
