      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, I've been working on a project about the history of ancient civilizations. It's quite fascinating to see how our ancestors lived and interacted with one another.",
