    {
      "id": 20,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "How do you feel about 'it'? That sounds like a fascinating project to work on!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T12:22:29.023726+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, that's interesting to hear! What has been the outcome of your work so far?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T12:30:04.544350+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's great to hear! I have been making progress in the project about ancient civilizations. It's fascinating how these ancient societies interacted and thrived.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T12:31:30.512902+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What is fascinating about ancient civilizations?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T12:33:05.388920+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "The history of ancient civilizations is indeed fascinating! There are so many aspects to explore, like their architecture, art, and societal structures.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T12:34:26.922168+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh wow that's cool!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T12:37:29.867264+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "It's fascinating how these ancient civilizations interacted and thrived. Do you think they had similar cultures or societies? What makes you think that?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T12:38:51.288934+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, I think that the way they interacted and thrived is interesting. It's amazing to see how different societies developed in a variety of ways.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T12:40:30.460991+00:00"
    }
